emical-corp-wlk-q2-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"WLK 2019 Q2","e":"wlk","d":"2019-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Albert Chao","x":"I think the industry consultant looking at prices to be relatively flat after the $0.02 a pound price increase we received in June.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/westlake-chemical-corp-wlk-q2-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"WLK 2019 Q2","e":"wlk","d":"2019-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Albert Chao","x":"And I think some of the industry consultants are forecasting not only the price increase in July, but down, further down the year, there would be further potential for the price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/westlake-chemical-corp-wlk-q2-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"WLK 2019 Q2","e":"wlk","d":"2019-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven Bender","x":"…primarily due to improved results in our Vinyls downstream products businesses, largely driven by seasonally higher volumes as the building and construction season got under way and with lower restructuring, acquisition and integrated costs, partially offset by lower caustic soda sales prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/westlake-chemical-corp-wlk-q2-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"WLK 2019 Q2","e":"wlk","d":"2019-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven Bender","x":"And certainly we also had some lower restructuring and transaction related cost also when you look at quarter one versus quarter two.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/westlake-chemical-corp-wlk-q2-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"WLK 2019 Q3","e":"wlk","d":"2019-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Albert Yuan Chao","x":"PVC prices I think IHS looking next year our price increase domestic in the U.S. and also for export price is pretty stable.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcr