.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/18/westlake-chemical-corp-wlk-q4-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"WLK 2020 Q1","e":"wlk","d":"2020-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"M. Steven Bender","x":"As we progress through the first quarter of 2020, we were beginning to see momentum for price increases in both of our segments prior to COVID-19 becoming a global pandemic late in the first quarter, which occurred at the same time we saw the significant decline in global oil prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/04/westlake-chemical-corp-wlk-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"WLK 2020 Q1","e":"wlk","d":"2020-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Albert Chao","x":"Sorry caustic price and then in March, there is additional $60 to $70 a ton in price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/04/westlake-chemical-corp-wlk-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"WLK 2020 Q1","e":"wlk","d":"2020-05-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"M. Steven Bender","x":"So Frank, we will continue to be very focused in corporate expenses, and I gave you the lower guidance on the capital numbers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/04/westlake-chemical-corp-wlk-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"WLK 2020 Q3","e":"wlk","d":"2020-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"M. Steven Bender","x":"Our olefins business continued to see strong global demand for polyethylene, which when combined with low industry inventory levels led to reported domestic price increases of $0.15 per pound from the end of the second quarter, as well as strength in export prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/westlake-chemical-corp-wlk-q3-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"WLK 2020 Q3","e":"wlk","d":"2020-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Albert Chao","x":"Building products have been increasing prices to reflect the PVC raw material price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/westlake-chemical-corp-wlk-q3-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"WLK 2020 Q3","e":"wlk","d":"2020-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"M. Steven Bender","x":"In September, we announced the closure of a non-integrated stand-alone PVC facility in Schkopau, Germany in connection with this restructuring of our European operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/westlake-chemical-corp-wlk-q3-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"WLK 2020 Q3","e":"wlk","d":"2020-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"M. Steven Bender","x":"The $101 million decrease in net income is a result of the impacts of Hurricane Laura and the restructuring charges just discussed, as well as higher ethane and ethylene feedstock cost in both our vinyls and olefins segment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/westlake-chemical-corp-wlk-q3-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"WLK 2020 Q4","e":"wlk","d":"2021-02-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Albert Chao","x":"And in 2021, industry pass through price increases of $0.04 a pound in January and $0.03 a pound in February.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/westlake-chemical-corp-wlk-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"WLK 2020 Q4","e":"wlk","d":"2021-02-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Albert Chao","x":"And also price announcements made for March with a price increase of $0.07 a pound.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/westlake-chemical-corp-wlk-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"WLK 2020 Q4","e":"wlk","d":"2021-02-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"M. Steven Bender","x":"The increase in net income was largely attributable to higher prices and margins for polyethylene and PVC resin as well as lower restructuring charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/westlake-chemical-corp-wlk-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":