"WLK 2025 Q4","e":"wlk","d":"2026-02-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Steven Bender","x":"And so therefore the impact to tariffs has really been de minimis, really immaterial.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/24/westlake-wlk-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WLK 2025 Q4","e":"wlk","d":"2026-02-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Steven Bender","x":"Frank, I would say that what we have seen all throughout the course of 2025 and, frankly, in the previous administration is that the current administration has really used the USMCA treaty as a way to make sure that those items that were embodied in that treaty are not hit with additional tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/24/westlake-wlk-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WLK 2025 Q4","e":"wlk","d":"2026-02-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"David L. Begleiter","x":"And just on polyethylene February, what are your expectations around your announced price increases and potential realization?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/24/westlake-wlk-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WLK 2025 Q4","e":"wlk","d":"2026-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jean-Marc Gilson","x":"Westlake's cost saving measures gained significant traction across every business in 2025, and we delivered over $170,000,000 of structural cost reductions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/24/westlake-wlk-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WLK 2025 Q4","e":"wlk","d":"2026-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jean-Marc Gilson","x":"These actions contributed to a 6% reduction in our headcount and an even more significant reduction in our contractor workforce in 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/24/westlake-wlk-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WLK 2026 Q1","e":"wlk","d":"2026-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"M. Bender","x":"Compared to the fourth quarter of 2025, PIM average sales price increased 3%, reflecting improved price realization for olefins, polyethylene, caustic soda toward the end of the quarter, while sales volumes increased 3%, excluding volumes associated with the 2025 plant shutdowns, while higher…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/westlake-wlk-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WLK 2026 Q1","e":"wlk","d":"2026-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jean-Marc Gilson","x":"As I discussed earlier, global supply chain disruptions and elevated global energy prices are driving meaningful price increases for polyethylene, PVC resin and other products in our PEM segment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/westlake-wlk-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WLK 2026 Q1","e":"wlk","d":"2026-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jean-Marc Gilson","x":"…earnings improvement from supply disruption in the Middle East and weather normalization, our first quarter results benefited from our 3-pillar profitability improvement plan, including delivering approximately $150 million of EBITDA uplift from footprint optimization and cost savings actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/westlake-wlk-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WLK 2026 Q1","e":"wlk","d":"2026-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"M. Bender","x":"In addition, we achieved substantial structural cost savings in the first quarter while also taking action to improve plant reliability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/westlake-wlk-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WLK 2026 Q2","e":"wlk","d":"2026-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Baksht","x":"We also passed through some increases in pricing in Q2 that you'll see through the back part of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/westlake-wlk-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WLK 2026 Q2","e":"wlk","d":"2026-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jean-Marc Gilson","x":"The actions that we took last year are generating significant cost savings that are contributing to our EBITDA improvement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/westlake-wlk-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WLK 2026 Q2","e":"wlk","d":"2026-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jean-Marc Gilson","x":"…optimization, which primarily consists of the shutdown of our epoxy plant in Pernis, a styrene plant in Lake Charles and 3 of our chlorvinyl plants in the U.S. These shutdowns took place last year and the associated cost savings from these actions are tracking ahead of plan so far in 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/westlake-wlk-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WLK 2026 Q3","e":"wlk","d":"2026-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jonathan H. Baksht","x":"And in other cases, we will be going out to the market with selling price increases to offset the inflationary pressure we have been facing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/westlake-wlk-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WLK 2026 Q3","e":"wlk","d":"2026-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jonathan H. Baksht","x":"We are working to implement our 5¢ per pound increase announcement In addition to the 5¢ per pound price increase realized in September, which will help to offset sequentially lower expected PEM sales volumes due to turnaround and seasonality.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/westlake-wlk-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WLK 2026 Q3","e":"wlk","d":"2026-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jean-Marc Gilson","x":"Turning to cash flow, we converted more of our EBITDA to free cash flow in the third quarter of 2026, as our capital expenditures of $188 million were $51 millio